{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "經教廣大也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二利行大"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "果德大也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "建立\n大佛事也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能通"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不懷力、安徤力、無惡力、人\n尊力"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孝也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "義也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "悌也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若具文云：佛言：「人懷愛欲，不見道者，譬如濁水，\n以五彩投其中，致力攪之，眾人共臨水上，無能覩其影。愛欲交錯，心中為濁，故不見道。若人漸解懺悔，來\n近知識，水澄穢除，清淨無垢，即自見形。又猛火著釜下，中水踊躍，以布覆上，眾生照臨，亦無覩其影者。心\n中本有三毒，涌沸在內，五葢覆外，終不見道。惡心垢盡，乃知魂靈所從來，生死所趣向，諸佛國土，道德所\n在耳。」釋曰：人下，初一節。法喻合結也。又猛下，次一節，喻合結也。會通配對，如上疏列。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "執唯一佛性，無有法性，一迷也。執法性與佛性為二體，倍迷也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此別業所感"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此同業所感"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "皮不是毛等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如好選詩文，偏講聲氣，賄囑要路，買求薦揚等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "桀之寵妃"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "紂之寵妃"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "幽王寵妃"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一峰脹、二青瘀、三壞、四血塗漫、五膿\n爛、六噉、七散、八白骨、九燒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一內有色相外觀色背捨、二內無色相外觀色背捨、三淨背捨身作證背捨、四空處\n背捨、五識處背捨、六無所有處背捨、七非非想處背捨、八滅受想背捨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一內有色相外觀色少勝處、二內有\n色相外觀色多勝處、三內無色相外觀色少勝處、四內無色相外觀色多勝處、五青勝處、六黃勝處、七赤\n勝處、八白勝處"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九想前方便也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "身見、邊見、\n戒取、見取、邪見也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "貪、瞋、\n痴、慢、疑也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "色盡超劫，受盡超見，想盡\n超煩惱，行盡超眾生，識盡超命"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "小則四果支佛，大則信、住、行、向\n也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "怪、󴒔、魅、蠱毒魘勝、厲、大力、川林、山海精、芝草、自在天"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "毀戒、謗法等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "發熱、口乾、舌苦等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "沒神\n失力、筋戰、畏寒、懼暑、悲風、苦雨等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "皮黃體瘦、腰酸、腿輭等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "癆怯\n渴痟、生瘡、發毒等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "好睡、懶行等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "傲師、陳友等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "色滅、血衰等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "輕天、褻神等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "罪罸、苦報等。略為十，廣四十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "人有五欲、七情，病有五癆、七傷。又四\n百四病，多從婬欲而起"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "耗損精氣，歲身喪命。故《廣成子》云「無搖汝精，乃可長\n生」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "萬惡婬為首故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "天道福善而禍婬故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "瞥爾睡去，室家男女便帶不去，受用不著。況死亡後，豈能相歡娛乎？復有愛成怨者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "忘身狗欲，死亡立至。《楞嚴》云「盛行貪欲，未逾年歲，肝腦枯竭，以至殂歿，墮無間獄」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二乘亦攝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "放生等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "殺生等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "界也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "空也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "欲色有也，無色無也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "比丘尼、優婆塞、優婆夷也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
